 "stimulus_html": "For the following exercises, use Graphs <i>A</i>, <i>B</i>, and <i>C</i>.\n<br>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/c041ab3891a0703c.png\" alt=\"Three graphs. Graph A has two overlapping quadrilaterals, s t u v and w x y z. An edge connects w to u. Graph B has two overlapping quadrilaterals, s t z y, and r v w x. A vertex, u is at the center of r v and t z. Graph C has six vertices. Edges connect s t, t v, v w, w x, x u, w u, u s, and u t.\">\n",
